Z||000008||saleenfiero||07-26-2001||11:34 AM||||Aus:  A few year ago in the last gen celica, we had the turbocharge 4 wheel drive versions, but now after the latest redsign, our celicas are front wheel drive only with either a 140(?) or 180 horse 4 cylinder.  I don't know about the rest of the world.  But why would you need four wheel drive on this car as it is right now?  The six speed can barely even spin the tires from a standstill anyway.||||reg||1
